                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">List of Authorities in re San Jose Scale.</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#flush">Bulletin No. 33, U. S. Department of Agriculture, Division of
                    Entomology, “Legislation,” etc., by Howard.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Bulletin No 3, new series, U. S. Department of Agriculture,
                    Division of Entomology, technical series, No. 6, 1897; U. S. Department of
                    Agriculture, Division of Entomology, “The San Jose Scale,” by Cockerell.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Insect Life, by Howard, U. S. Department of Agriculture,
                    Division of Entomology, Vols. VI, VII, Nos. 2, 4, and 5.</p>
                <p rendition="#flush">Report, Eighth Annual Meeting Association of Entomologists,
                    1896, being Bulletin No. 6, new series, U. S. Department of Agriculture,
                    Division of Entomology.</p>
            </div>
